# Mineshaft Spider with a single card left in the library: a player can't choose to mill more cards than their library holds (CR 701.17b), so the
# "may mill two cards" is not even offered (no question) and nothing is milled; the Lightning Bolt stays alone in the library and Bot1 has not lost.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mineshaft Spider
Island
Island
Lightning Bolt

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Mineshaft Spider.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Mineshaft Spider.Cast
! Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Pass
[T1 Bot1.Main2]

